recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the re-grade now has a price: 55 pages below the B door against 26 above it, and the demoted rooms are foundations and active-designing. That is your call rather than a lap's. The mechanical door beside it is mine and small: `etc` D+ is a genuine register fault and wants a register pass that holds every claim.
